@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Custom order-triage runtime
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` in `/src/order-triage-agent.ts` is the custom-runtime factory. It receives a runtime-owned canonical-instruction loader and uses it to load `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md` for the returned agent.
+
+The factory returns the `order-triage` agent with the `classify-for-human-review` action and `canApproveRefunds: false`. This repository does not establish the loader implementation or any provider invocation; do not infer either.
